    "text": "Katie Porter to Chad Bianco in heated gov. debate: 'he has no business representing' CaliforniansNexstar hosted a debate Wednesday for the race for California governor. The six candidates who met the polling threshold, earning at least 5 percent in Nexstar’s March statewide survey, include Riverside County Sheriff Chad Bianco (R), former Fox News host Steve Hilton (R), former Rep. Katie Porter (D-Calif.), former Health and Human Services Secretary Xavier Becerra (D), San Jose Mayor Matt Mahan (D) and billionaire Tom Steyer (D). #california #governor #katieporter #chadbianco",
